      "id": "claim_6daedcd8597946a1b4e5d04a9754060f",
      "statement": "The Code system uses hexadecimal digits per interior lattice point with bit values 8=N, 4=S, 2=E, 1=W; the formatted Code {columns}x{rows}y{lattice}[r{repeats}] is the meander's entire identity and the unique index over code is the only uniqueness constraint.",
