      "id": "claim_71269da7790a40fe8f168a76acf290d1",
      "statement": "The meanders table has columns id (uuidv7), code (text, unique), rows/columns/lattice/repeats (denormalized), is_hardcoded (boolean), symmetrical_codes (text[]), and characteristics (jsonb sparse map); all columns are snake_case via shared SnakeNamingStrategy.",
