      "id": "claim_b64ff303c3a9415f837715468f9fc067",
      "statement": "The characteristics jsonb column holds every Characteristic in a sparse map: numeric keys present only when non-zero, boolean keys present only when true; missing key means zero or false; raw SQL reads via COALESCE((characteristics ->> 'key')::numeric, 0).",
