    {
      "id": "claim_e29961da99534146a1b9d82cd7fbcb74",
      "statement": "The corpus is partitioned by is_hardcoded into two disjoint halves: hardcoded (963 historical corpus meanders beyond the 16-edge budget, ingested first, filtered by shape against fixed HISTORICAL_CORPUS_EDGE_BUDGET) and enumerated (every structurally distinct repeat within the configurable EDGE_BUDGET, one per symmetry class).",
