      "id": "claim_037562f3695843be9a9b01118f28ba59",
      "statement": "Enumeration is bounded by a single edge budget (columns * (2 * rows - 1) <= EDGE_BUDGET); TileEnumerationService.orbitMinima walks every edge assignment as a bitmask and keeps only those no symmetry element sends lower, using SymmetryService.edgePermutations as byte lookup tables; SymmetryService.canonicalTile folds each to the representative.",
